{"ref":"character:lucia-zero","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Bill_Rizer.gif","w":40,"h":40}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Operation Guns)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Lucia Zero is a playable character from the Operation Guns DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-C-U-Laser.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:c-u-laser"}," ",{"t":"C-U-Laser","r":"weapon:c-u-laser"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["9 May 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Lucia"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["FB_LUCIA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["FB_Lucia"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-C-U-Laser.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:c-u-laser"}," ",{"t":"C-U-Laser","r":"weapon:c-u-laser"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Evolving the Spread Shot"]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Operation_Guns.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Blue Gale\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Recovery","cells":[["1.00"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Revival","cells":[["+1"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+8"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Lucia Zero can be unlocked for purchase by evolving the ",{"i":"Sprite-Spread_Shot.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spread-shot"}," ",{"t":"Spread Shot","r":"weapon:spread-shot"},". She needs to be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Lucia Zero can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"amitheoriginal\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Lucia starts with +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},", +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"},", and +8 ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Reroll","r":"powerup:reroll"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["When Lucia uses a Revival, she gains +20 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +0.1 Recovery, +0.2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"},", +8% Movement Speed, +4% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", +4% ",{"i":"Sprite-Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},", +4% ",{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},", +4% ",{"i":"Sprite-Area.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"},", -3% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", +0.2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Amount.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"},", +0.2 Revival, +5% ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", +5% ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"},", and +1% ",{"i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"}," for the rest of the run."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["This will not happen if Lucia is a follower nor if she is revived via coffin in co-op mode. The latter prevents Lucia from easily scaling her stats infinitely, as co-op mode allows players to be revived even if they have 0 Revivals."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Lucia can find special Operation Guns pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Lucia needs ",{"i":"Sprite-Tirajisú.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:tirajisu"}," ",{"t":"Tirajisú","r":"passive:tirajisu"}," in order to maximize her revivals and evolve her starting weapon. ",{"i":"Sprite-Phieraggi.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:phieraggi"}," ",{"t":"Phieraggi","r":"weapon:phieraggi"},", which also evolves using Tirajisú and scales with revivals, is highly recommended."]},{"c":["The ",{"i":"Sprite-Awake_(IV).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," ",{"t":"Awake (IV)","r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," arcana is essentially a must-have as it provides several additional revivals and further scales stats upon revival. Assuming Revival is picked in the shop, the player has both Tirajisú and Awake, and a ",{"i":"Sprite-Weapon_Power-Up.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:weapon-power-up"}," ",{"t":"Weapon Power-Up","r":"passive:weapon-power-up"}," is picked to evolve Lucia's main weapon, she can revive up to 8 times."]},{"c":["Further Revivals are difficult to obtain on most maps. ",{"i":"Sprite-Paranormal_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"t":"Paranormal Scan","r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," can potentially represent a source of Revivals. On stages from Operation Guns, more Weapon Power-Ups can be obtained for further Revivals. In ",{"t":"Abyss Foscari","r":"stage:abyss-foscari"}," only, Lucia can get 2 extra Revivals by picking up the ",{"i":"Sprite-Academy_Badge.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:academy-badge"}," ",{"t":"Academy Badge","r":"passive:academy-badge"}," on the ground."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Lucia_Zero.png","w":120,"h":116,"c":["Lucia Zero's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Lucia_Zero.gif","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Lucia_Zero_(Ranged_Attack).gif","w":113,"h":120,"c":["Ranged attack animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Lucia","x":"https://contra.fandom.com/wiki/Lucia"}," at the ",{"t":" Contra Wiki","x":"https://contra.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}